# Shipped agent definitions (#219) — a BYTE-IDENTICAL mirror of `.claude/agents/`, which lives
# outside every package and is therefore linted by nothing (the root `mdlint:check` adds only a
# non-recursive `'*.md'`). markdownlint runs with `--dot` over `**/*.md` inside each package, so
# without this entry only the DATASET copy is linted: a rule violation would be rewritten there
# by `pnpm format` and nowhere else, and the byte-equality mirror test would then fail with no
# formatter able to fix both sides. Same reason `.prettierignore`, the eslint config and the
# knowledge-hub vitest config all exclude `dataset/.workflows/` — shipping a directory into a
# package brought it under tool scopes its root twin is not under, and they must agree.
#
# Anchored (the pattern contains a slash) to the directory markdownlint runs in, i.e. the
# package being linted — `packages/knowledge-hub`.
